// DO NOT EDIT THIS FILE. It ships with s2script and an upgrade OVERWRITES it — any change
// you make here is lost on the next update. To fix or add an entry on a live server, drop a
// .jsonc file in gamedata/sdkhooks/custom/ instead: it is applied last, replaces whole named
// entries, needs no rebuild, and survives upgrades. See docs/INSTALL.md ("Hot-fixing a
// broken signature").
//
// Gamedata master index for the "sdkhooks" owner — SourceMod's sdkhooks.games equivalent.
// Shim/core MAY name these keys (extension kind); they are read from s_gdSdkhooks, never
// s_gdCore. See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-30-sdkhooks-virtuals-design.md.
//
// FILE NAMING follows SourceMod's: `game.cstrike.txt` carries the target. Later entries
// override earlier ones at the NAMED-ENTRY level. <owner>/custom/*.jsonc is applied last.
{
  "files": [
    { "file": "game.cs2.jsonc", "game": "csgo" }
  ]
}
